{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはじめに！\n5月生まれの方1ヶ月遅れごめんなさい:(´◦ω◦｀):もう6月の中旬なのに。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルだったからとか言い訳は\nしません(；д；)本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/06/16/2824278/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/06/16/2824278/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/06/16/2824278/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/06/16/2824278/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう5月生まれの方は\n皆さんとっくに過ぎてしまっているのですが、お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月生まれのお誕生日の方\nコメントお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次かその次のブログには\nもう6月お誕生日の方のお名前を\nのせます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、プリンシパルについて書いてたら少し長めになっちゃって\nまたブログが長くなっちゃうと\nいけないから分けて書くことにしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日また、プリンシパルの事とかについてブログ更新するからみてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/06/16/2824278/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままちゃんにこの写真の口が\n妖怪みたい！っていわれた(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、わざと載せるの！笑"}],"source":"archive"}